  "proof_logic": [
    "A connected still life with more than four cells contains no live 2x2 block, since such a block is an isolated 8-connected component.",
    "The Chu--Stuckey identity gives total wastage 2*n^2+4*n-4*population=36 at n=14, population 103.",
    "All local wastage terms are nonnegative, so the physical depth-four boundary belt of such a board has charge <=36.",
    "The complete block-free boundary language enumerates all 2,664 abstract cycle orbits and all 261,225 physical low-slack belts admitted by that charge budget.",
    "Exact completion of each remaining 4x4 centre produces 224 stable population-103 boards, all disconnected.",
    "The independently verified connected 102 witness supplies the matching lower bound, hence C(14)=102."
  ],
